# BTS Take Home Test

REST API application built using Spring Boot, PostgreSQL, JWT Authentication, Swagger OpenAPI Documentation, and Docker.

---

## Tech Stack

- Java 17
- Spring Boot 3.5.5
- Spring Security
- JWT (Json Web Token)
- Spring Data JPA
- PostgreSQL
- Maven
- Swagger OpenAPI
- Docker

---

## Features

### Authentication

- Register User
- Login User
- JWT Access Token
- JWT Refresh Token

### Product Management

- Create Product
- Update Product
- Delete Product
- Get Product By Id
- Get Product List
- Search Product
- Filter By Category
- Pagination

### Security

- JWT Authentication
- Stateless Session
- Protected Endpoints

### Additional Features

- Global Exception Handling
- Validation Request
- Audit Fields
    - createdAt
    - updatedAt
    - createdBy
    - updatedBy
- Rate Limiting

---

## API Documentation

Swagger UI:

http://localhost:8080/documentation-api

OpenAPI:

http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

---

## Database Configuration

Default configuration:

```properties
spring.datasource.url=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/test_bts
spring.datasource.username=postgres
spring.datasource.password=1
```